    "paragraph": "A location-aware calibration framework was developed and validated across eight diverse urban sites in Loughborough Town Centre to mitigate sensor bias in pedestrian analytics. In Dhaka's Gulistan and Gulshan commercial areas, researchers analyzed the mobility patterns and socio-economic characteristics of 384 small business owners and employees using descriptive statistics, multiple regression, and Principal Component Analysis. Finally, a robust vehicle routing model was designed for humanitarian logistics to coordinate trucks and flexible docking drones under hierarchical delivery deadlines and uncertain drone energy consumption.",
